# Header active nav cove light PNG (required)

The desktop main nav **must** keep the recessed cove light image on the current page item (`.main-nav > li.active::after`), desktop only (`min-width: 1367px`). Matches mockup variant 1 (soft warm wash from top).

## Asset rules

- Active light asset: `/images/header/nav-light-opt03-true-alpha.png`
- CSS box: **200×200**, background `center -13px / 150px 150px` (clip via `overflow: hidden` on active `li`)
- Active `li` uses `overflow: hidden` so the wash cannot spill into neighboring labels

## Do not remove

- Placement: `::after` pinned to `top: 0`, centered over the active item
- Segment accent text colors on `.has-mega-menu[data-menu-panel=…]` (`--nav-accent`)
- Desktop L1 labels (`min-width: 1367px`) are always `#543727` (default, hover, open, active)
- Segment accent colors still apply to mega-menu panel chrome via `--nav-accent`

## Do not re-add

- Soft accent pill fill on desktop active items
- Accent underline / bottom bar on active items
- Width-only CSS that stretches a mismatched PNG

CTA/button work in `header-contact-menu.css` is separate — changing the Connect button must **not** strip nav cove rules from `header.css`.
